    "work_id": "oglt-pl/patricius/pl53_15_pr",
    "canonical_ref": "PL53.PR.1.s2",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "Salomon : Molius cat arguere quam irasci ( Et­ cli. xx, 1).",
    "chunk_index": 2,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 445,
    "date_range": [
      430,
      461
    ],
    "date_confidence": "approximate",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "oglt-pl/patricius/pl53_15_pr#PL53.PR.2",
    "work_id": "oglt-pl/patricius/pl53_15_pr",
    "canonical_ref": "PL53.PR.2",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "Patricius ait : Non oportet judices Ecclesiæ habere timorem bominum, sed timorem Dei; quia Timor Dei principium sapientiæ est (Psal. ex, 10).",
    "chunk_index": 3,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 445,
    "date_range": [
      430,
      461
    ],
    "date_confidence": "approximate",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "oglt-pl/patricius/pl53_15_pr#PL53.PR.3",
    "work_id": "oglt-pl/patricius/pl53_15_pr",
    "canonical_ref": "PL53.PR.3",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "Non oportet judices Ecclesiae Dei habere sapientiam hujus mundi; quia sapientia hujus mundi stultitia est apud Deum (I Cor. III, 19); sed sapientiam Dei ha­ bere.",
    "chunk_index": 4,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 445,
    "date_range": [
      430,
      461
    ],
    "date_confidence": "approximate",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "oglt-pl/patricius/pl53_15_pr#PL53.PR.4",
    "work_id": "oglt-pl/patricius/pl53_15_pr",
    "canonical_ref": "PL53.PR.4",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "Non oportet judices Ecclesiæ munera suscipere : quia munera excæcant oculos sapientium, et mutant verba justorum (Deut. XVI, 19).",
    "chunk_index": 5,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 445,
    "date_range": [
      430,
      461
    ],
    "date_confidence": "approximate",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "oglt-pl/patricius/pl53_15_pr#PL53.PR.5",
    "work_id": "oglt-pl/patricius/pl53_15_pr",
    "canonical_ref": "PL53.PR.5",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "Non oportet judices Ecclesiæ habere personam in judicio : quia Non est acceptio personarum apud Deum (Rom. II, 11).",
    "chunk_index": 6,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 445,
    "date_range": [
      430,
      461
    ],
    "date_confidence": "approximate",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "oglt-pl/patricius/pl53_15_pr#PL53.PR.6",
    "work_id": "oglt-pl/patricius/pl53_15_pr",
    "canonical_ref": "PL53.PR.6",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "Non oportet judices Ecclesix cautelam sæcularem habere, sed exempla divina : quia non oportet ser­ vum Dei cautum esse vel astutum.",
    "chunk_index": 7,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 445,
    "date_range": [
      430,
      461
    ],
    "date_confidence": "approximate",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "oglt-pl/patricius/pl53_15_pr#PL53.PR.7",
    "work_id": "oglt-pl/patricius/pl53_15_pr",
    "canonical_ref": "PL53.PR.7",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "Non oportet judices Ecclesiæ tam veloces esse in judicio, donec sciant quam verum flat quod scriptum est: Noli judex esse cito (Prov. xxv, 8).",
    "chunk_index": 8,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 445,
    "date_range": [
      430,
      461
    ],
    "date_confidence": "approximate",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "oglt-pl/patricius/pl53_15_pr#PL53.PR.8",
    "work_id": "oglt-pl/patricius/pl53_15_pr",
    "canonical_ref": "PL53.PR.8",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "Non oportet judices Ecclesiæ volubiles esse.",
    "chunk_index": 9,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 445,
    "date_range": [
      430,
      461
    ],
    "date_confidence": "approximate",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "oglt-pl/patricius/pl53_15_pr#PL53.PR.9.s1",
    "work_id": "oglt-pl/patricius/pl53_15_pr",
    "canonical_ref": "PL53.PR.9.s1",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "Non oportet judices Ecclesiae mendacium dicere; quia magnum crimen est mendacium.",
    "chunk_index": 10,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 445,
    "date_range": [
      430,
      461
    ],
    "date_confidence": "approximate",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "oglt-pl/patricius/pl53_15_pr#PL53.PR.9.s2",
    "work_id": "oglt-pl/patricius/pl53_15_pr",
    "canonical_ref": "PL53.PR.9.s2",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "Sed oportet judices Ecclesiæ rectum judicium judicare; quia in quocunque judicio judicaverint, judicabitur de eis.",
    "chunk_index": 11,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 445,
    "date_range": [
